// ============================================================================
// nutcracker.js — the Nutcracker tamer (unlockable in the Shop -> Unlockables -> Tamers, 1 diamond).
// The art is the classic wooden-soldier sprite sheet supplied by the user (idle: 4 front-view frames; walk: 4 frames
// facing right), cropped, background removed, scaled and packed into ONE small PNG that is embedded below as a data
// URI, so it needs no separate image file. Registers PLAYER_MODELS.nutcracker (entities.js) with its own frame source:
//   getSprite(kind, index) -> a small offscreen canvas (cached), or null until the sheet has loaded.
// Sheet layout: 8 cells of NUT_CELL_W x NUT_CELL_H pixels (stored at 2x), in the order idle0..3, walk0..3.
// The game draws him at half that size (~52 px tall, a little taller than the 48 px girl / boy).
// Depends on: entities.js (PLAYER_MODELS).
// ============================================================================
